<title>JAPAN: Tokyo-Mitsubishi - 6mth group results(SEC).</title>
<headline>Tokyo-Mitsubishi - 6mth group results(SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     1.52 trln	 vs	    1.78 trln</p>
<p> Pre-tax	     59.85		vs	   69.49</p>
<p> Net		   22.22		vs	   23.54</p>
<p> EPS		    4.78 yen	  vs	    5.09 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi Ltd is a major bank resulting from the merger of former Bank of Tokyo Ltd and former Mitsubishi Bank Ltd, as of April 1, 1996. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
